- **SQL for Data Science** — UC Davis (Sep 2021)

### Additional

- **Associate Professor** at SPbPU (Jan 2019 – Feb 2023): Developed and delivered AI courses to undergraduate and postgraduate audiences, evidencing strong cross-disciplinary communication and teaching capabilities.
- **Lecturer** at EPIC Institute of Technology (Aug 2024 – Present): Designed and taught a two-semester course on Data Science and Machine Learning (30+ lectures).
- **Expert** at karpov.courses (Mar 2024 – Aug 2025): Provided expert guidance on data-based decision making course materials.
- Fluent in English (C1, with extensive teaching and presenting experience).
