- **Issue**: The VOKI Games entry contains strong pre-training efficiency achievements (profiling, parallelism, architecture co-design), but these are buried among churn prediction, player embeddings, and GenAI level design—none of which are relevant to foundation model pre-training.
- **Action**: 
