  - Add a bullet or phrase: *"Analyzed GPU microarchitecture bottlenecks (e.g., warp occupancy, memory bandwidth saturation) using Nsight Compute to inform kernel fusion and launch configuration."*
  - Expand low-precision training: *"Experimented with MXFP8 and MXFP4 formats in training loops, evaluating numerical stability and throughput trade-offs on NVIDIA Blackwell GPUs."* (alter only where truthful; if no hands-on Blackwell experience exists, simply state "H100/B200-class architectures" to avoid fabrication).
