### Key Achievements

- Engineered **15+ production ML systems** on scalable infrastructure (Kubernetes, Docker, Spark, Databricks), consistently optimizing for throughput and resource efficiency — delivered **>300% ROI** across FMCG deployments (KFC, Mars, Henkel, Unilever, Perfetti Van Melle).
- Designed and shipped a **deep sequence-model embedding** using the **Mamba (State Space Model) architecture in PyTorch**, capturing long-range behavioral patterns in player telemetry — reduced player segmentation mismatches by **30%**.
