 complex refining processes and building a scalable backend with Python, K8s, and Kafka.\n\n### Skills\n\n* **Languages:** Python, SQL  \n* **Frameworks:** PyTorch, TensorFlow, LightGBM, XGBoost  \n* **Data & MLOps:** Databricks, PySpark, Docker, Kubernetes, Airflow, Pandas, NumPy  \n* **LLM & GenAI:** Transformers, LangChain, FAISS, RAG pipelines  \n* **Profiling Tools:** PyTorch Profiler, Nsight Systems, Nsight Compute  \n* **Distributed Programming:** NCCL, MPI  \n* **Soft Skills:** Trade-off analysis, Collaboration, Ownership, Open communication  \n\n### Education\n\n* **2021**: PhD Candidate in Computer Science – SPbPU (ABD)  \n* **2017**: MSc in Technical Systems Management – SPbPU, Russia  \n* **2015**: BSc in Computer Sciences – SPbPU, Russia  \n* **2013**: Erasmus Exchange – Czech Technical University, Prague (full program in English)\n\n### Certifications\n\n* **Generative AI** – DeepLearning.AI (Jan 2024)  \n* **Advanced Data Science** – IBM (Jul 2023)  \n* **SQL for Data Science** – UC Davis (Sep 2021)  \n\n### Additional\n\n* Fluent in English (C1 proficiency).\n* Recommendations from professionals and leaders at top-tier tech companies available on [LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/in/nkudriashov/details/recommendations/?detailScreenTabIndex=0)."
